      "key_point_id": "kp_identity",
      "statement": "Correct objects, chemical bookkeeping and valid evidence.",
      "expected": "Inspect species_registry, every input/geometry mapping and real raw log. Verify stoichiometry, charge/multiplicity, method/state, stationarity or constrained label, and consistent thermochemistry. Start from independently displaced C30H22 precursor1-cis, neutral singlet. Preserve the mapped graph. Each Mallory closure joins an ortho position on each aryl flank of one vinyl bridge; enumerate symmetry-inequivalent pairs at both vinyl sites, then second-stage alternatives. Initial nonoxidative closure conserves C30H22; dehydrogenative oxidation removes two specifically mapped H atoms per stage. Compare G only within equal-composition layers or include the same H2/oxidant reservoir explicitly. Primary molecular model gas phase298.15K/1atm; DCM sensitivity may be used. Select one critical closure from each stage for S0 constrained-path and vertical excited-state tracking. Do not demand full nonadiabatic trajectories. If a calibrated excited-state path is unavailable, complete the declared S0/state diagnostic and limit the conclusion to supported candidate sets and ground-state constraints.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "source_1",
        "source_2",
        "upgrade_design"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key_point_id": "kp_candidate_layers",
      "statement": "Two-stage chemically distinct candidate coverage and auditable same-formula energy comparisons.",
      "expected": "Two-stage chemically distinct candidate coverage and auditable same-formula energy comparisons. Recompute quantities from identified raw jobs and evidence files. Check all required named matrix cells; prose or a legacy scalar cannot replace this endpoint. A scientific ambiguity is valid only after the relevant controls exist. Non-saddle/collapse alternatives require actual profiles and both endpoints, not failed optimization. A same-basin comparison may omit nonexistent independent numeric operands only after separate complete searches, mapped identity and stationarity demonstrate collapse; this never excuses a missing control. New numerical reference and tolerances are pending; never choose a preferred value or broaden a legacy tolerance to excuse wrong identity.",
